                                ></path>
                            </svg>
                        </CardIcon>
                        <CardTitle>
                            Analytics &amp; Reporting
                        </CardTitle>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                            Make data-driven decisions with comprehensive
                            analytics and insights
                        </p>
                        <ul class="space-y-3">
                            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
